 {"id": 1968786, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1674i.jpg"}, {"id": 1968784, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1674g.jpg"}, {"id": 1968738, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16736.jpg"}, {"id": 1968787, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1674j.jpg"}], "slug": "the-labyrinth--4", "storyline": "Ten years ago, five friends entered an ancient garden shaped like a maze. Days later, only one man came out, covered in blood and unable to explain what had happened. Convicted of the murders, he insisted until the end that something lived inside the maze: something that watched from the shadows, changed the paths and hunted his friends. No one believed him. When a video of his last interview spreads online, a group of young people decides to enter the maze to uncover the truth.", "summary": "The Labyrinth is a first-person co-op horror game for up to six players. Players explore a living hedge maze that reshapes itself, activate altars to unlock the exit gate and revive downed allies before it is too late. Flashlights reveal the creatures that roam the maze, but light and noise also attract them. The game supports solo play, online and LAN co-op, two-player split-screen co-op and a Versus mode.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-labyrinth--4"}